	(text "6-axis IMU: LSM6DSO on the system I2C (addr 0x6B, SA0 high; 0x6A is the BQ25180)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "965247e8-d111-51bf-b5cf-2ad4e75b31d3")
	)
	(text "Always on (+3V3). Asleep: accelerometer only, ultra-low-power 12.5 Hz, gyroscope powered down (5.5 uA typ,\nAN5192 Table 9), wake-up interrupt while the ESP32 is in deep sleep. Awake: gyroscope on (0.30 mA at 52 Hz low-power).\nCS high = I2C. SA0 high (no internal pull-up by default). SDx / SCx to GND, OCS_Aux / SDO_Aux unconnected.\nINT1 -> IMU_INT1 (GPIO15, RTC: deep-sleep wake on pickup), INT2 -> IMU_INT2 (GPIO16). Push-pull, no pulls:\nINT1 must be low or floating while the IMU powers up (its own pull-down holds it).\n100n + 10u at VDD (pin 8), 100n at VDDIO (pin 5). Keep away from the buck-boost inductor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(italic yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ad137a50-624f-5b3d-ab59-3516a059266f")
	)
